{"id":"vecino","lemma":"vecino","pos":"noun","rank":1528,"glosses":["neighbour (a person living on adjacent or nearby land)","a resident or inhabitant of an area, especially of a neighborhood or a village","freeman, person of relatively high status associated with a place"],"ipa":"/beˈθino/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"vecinos","feminine":"vecina","femininePlural":"vecinas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/c/c8/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-vecino.wav","formAudio":{"vecina":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/4/40/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-vecina.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Yo soy tu vecino.","en":"I'm your neighbor.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/443630"},{"text":"Vamos a ser vecinos.","en":"We'll be neighbors.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/501320"},{"text":"Odio a mi vecina.","en":"I hate my neighbor."},{"text":"¿Quiénes son mis vecinas nuevas?","en":"Who are my new neighbors?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/523219"},{"text":"Tom es nuestro vecino.","en":"Tom is our neighbor.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/164676"}]}